ng?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, that was my mistake, missing the Knack. You're good, Relicwise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T13:31:24-07:00","id":1197312,"title":"","content":"The attributes look like some points are missing. My understanding is that it should be 1 in each attribute, +6 in primary arena, +4 in secondary arena, +2 in tertiary arena, + 2 in each attribute in the favored approach (for a total of 6), +1 from Finishing Touches. That should add up to 28 total attribute dots (9 + 6 + 4 + 2 + 6 + 1) and SCION has 24. <br /> <br /> It looks like the skills may be low as well, I added them up to 21 when they should add up to 23 (9 primary + 6 secondary + 3 tertiary + 5 bonus).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1039-brennanhawkwood","name":"Brennanhawkwood","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T14:36:56-07:00","id":1197335,"title":"","content":"u'r right<br /> <br /> i didn't add the point from the favored approach for attribute and finishing touches for th skills<br /> <br /> <br /> i would love to see some of your fresh new character, would be a good example for everyone trying to understand how to make a sheet","signature":"","ed